I would wait until you have an easy way to ID mass amounts of items
before you proceed to polypiling. A spellbook of ID with the ability
to cast it is optimal here. Some people would probably encourage you
to polypile spellbooks to get ID, but it's not worth it at an early
level. So stockpile scrolls, potions, amulets, rings, magical armor,
perhaps even some magical tools. I particularly enjoy zapping amulets
of strangulation into amulets of life saving.

